to son Kimbal Musk and daughters Tosca, Alexandra and Asha Rose Musk. He has also fathered two children, a son and a daughter, with his stepdaughter Jana Bezuidenhout.\\n\\nThough Errol has made headlines in recent years after the births of his ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/human-interest/who-is-errol-musk-elon-musk-father/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... Every Woman Elon Musk Has Children With — and What They've Said About Their Blended Family\\nauthor: Skyler Caruso\\ndate: 2025-04-01\\n---\\nElon Musk is the dad of 14 kids.\\n\\nThe Tesla founder fathered his children with four different women over two decades. Musk welcomed his first ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/all-about-elon-musk-mothers-of-children-blended-family-8668121\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... The South African woman, 46-year-old Riette Nel (formerly van Deventer), claims that her mom, Riana van Deventer, confessed to Riana's son/Riette's half-brother, Gerrit van Deventer, on her deathbed in October of 2019 that Elon's father, 75-year-old Errol Musk, was ... \",\"title\":\"https://radaronline.com/p/elon-musk-first-photos-sighting-half-sister-dad-dna-test/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... People took to X, formerly Twitter, to share their reactions to Musk's statements. One person wrote, \\\"Elon Musk just deadnamed his own trans daughter to hundreds of millions. He is exactly the kind of father so many trans people have had to run away from, hide from ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/elon-musk-sparks-backlash-incorrectly-193432795.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"859c4a75d729afd7ddf7336a016348f315e0c839584f246ab63403afade2413f\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e679169ccac4d8bd051d35516337cc531bd263c59a12fa554d518fda749cdf91\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"woman claimed Elon Musk daughter related\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grimes – Mother to X Æ A-Xii, Exa Dark Sideræl and Techno\\n\\nMusk and the \\\"Oblivion\\\" singer's first son, X Æ A-Xii, was born in May 2020.\\n\\nIn December 2021, the couple quietly welcomed their daughter, Exa Dark Sideræl via surrogate.\\n\\nTheir son, originally named X ... \",\"title\":\"https://nypost.com/2024/06/23/us-news/elon-musks-12-kids-and-counting-what-to-know-about-the-tesla-billionaires-big-brood/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... Elon Musk's 14 Children: All About the Tesla CEO's Sons and Daughters (and the 4 Women He Shares Them With)\\nauthor: Skyler Caruso\\ndate: 2025-06-06\\n---\\nElon Musk has welcomed 14 children over 20 years.\\n\\nThe Tesla founder first became a father in 2002 when ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/all-about-elon-musk-children-11678749\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2025-01-01\\n---\\nElon Musk Attempts To Go Incognito In First Sighting Since Alleged Half-Sister